                  <!--FEATURE STORY START HERE-->

                  <table>
                    <tbody>
                      <tr>
                        <td valign="top"><a href=
                        "index.html"><img src="index_files/issues.gif"
                             border="0" alt=
                             "Microsoft goes open-source!"
                             width="122" height="99"></a></td>

                        <td valign="top"><img src=
                        "index_files/1ptrans.gif" width="1"
                             height="3" border="0"><br>
                        December 5, 2003 9:00 a.m. PST<br>
                        <b>Microsoft
                        Goes Open-Source!</b><br>
                        With a shocking announcement this morning
			Bill Gates is moving his company into a new
			era. All Microsoft software will be from now
			on free and open-source. Anybody 
			will be able to get a copy of the Microsoft applications
			they learned to love... for free! Not only,
			users will have free access to the source code itself!
                        <br>
                        <br>
                        <a href=
                        "thestory.html"><img src="index_files/more.gif"
                             alt="More..." hspace="5" align=
                             "middle" width="46" height="9" border=
                             "0"></a></td>
                      </tr>

                      <tr valign="top">
                        <td valign="top"></td>

                        <td valign="top"><img src=
                        "index_files/dotted_line_shortest.gif"
                             alt=" " width="231" height="1" vspace=
                             "10" border="0"></td>
                      </tr>
                    </tbody>
                  </table><!--FEATURE STORY END HERE-->
                  <!--FEATURE STORY START HERE-->

                  <table>
                    <tbody>
                      <tr>
                        <td valign="top"><a href=
                        "http://www.microsoft.com/presspass/features/2003/nov03/11-19SPOTfashion.asp">
                        <img src="index_files/spot2-thumb.jpg"
                        border="0" alt=
                        "Ready-to-Wear Wireless Fashion Show Provides Sneak Peek at New Smart Watches with MSN Direct"
                             width="122" height="99"></a></td>

                        <td valign="top"><img src=
                        "index_files/1ptrans.gif" width="1"
                             height="3" border="0"><br>
                        November 19, 2003 1:00 p.m. PST<br>
                        <b><a href=
                        "http://www.microsoft.com/presspass/features/2003/nov03/11-19SPOTfashion.asp">
                        Ready-to-Wear Wireless Fashion Show
                        Provides Sneak Peek at New Smart Watches
                        with MSN Direct</a></b><br>
                        Fashion meets function: Microsoft SPOT
                        technology hits the catwalk at COMDEX Las
                        Vegas 2003.<br>
                        <br>
                        <a href=
                        "http://www.microsoft.com/presspass/features/2003/nov03/11-19SPOTfashion.asp">
                        <img src="index_files/more.gif" alt=
                        "More..." hspace="5" align="middle"
